# User Settings

The application includes a comprehensive user settings system that allows users to customize their experience.

## Settings Pages

- [settings/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/page.tsx) - Main settings page with tabs
- [components/ProfileSettings.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/components/ProfileSettings.tsx) - Profile settings component
- [components/GamePreferences.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/components/GamePreferences.tsx) - Game preferences component
- [components/DisplaySettings.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/components/DisplaySettings.tsx) - Display settings component

## Settings API

- [get-user-settings.ts](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/api/get-user-settings.ts) - API to fetch user settings
- [update-user-settings.ts](mdc:goweb/src/app/settings/api/update-user-settings.ts) - API to update user settings

## Backend Implementation

- [UserSettingsController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/UserSettingsController.java) - Settings controller
- [UserSettingsService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/UserSettingsService.java) - Settings service
- [UserSettingsEntity.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/entities/UserSettingsEntity.java) - Settings entity
- [UserSettingsDto.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/dto/UserSettingsDto.java) - Settings DTO
